reagent-name-neuroacid-cobra = cobra neurotoxin
reagent-desc-neuroacid-cobra = A dangerous neurotoxin produced inside a space cobra.

neuroacid-effect-first = Your lungs burn and a tremor runs through your body.
neuroacid-effect-second = Your thoughts turn to fog.
neuroacid-effect-third = A colored haze covers your eyes.
neuroacid-effect-fourth = Your skin and insides burn.

gases-n611 = N-611

reagent-name-n611 = N-611
reagent-desc-n611 = A military-grade neurotoxin refined from space cobra venom.

reagent-name-n611p = N-611-P
reagent-desc-n611p = A stabilized N-611. It causes vivid hallucinations and deep sleep, and barely harms tissue.

reagent-name-a517 = A-517
reagent-desc-a517 = A slow neurotoxin. Weak on its own, but lethal to a body already on the edge.

reagent-name-v903 = V-903
reagent-desc-v903 = A caustic A-517 derivative. It destroys cells, burns tissue and causes bleeding.

